   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Sunlit film: lifted warm shadows (53,48,19), median ~120, highlights ~202 kept soft, red-orange dominant, medium saturation (0.26), warm skin (hue 31). Best for: Backlit golden-hour sessions, warm sunny outdoor mandaps, relaxed candid moments, beach weddings. Shadows glow amber instead of going black.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
